message: "If you find this pipeline useful in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "NGS Pipeline: a unified Snakemake workflow for RNA-seq, WES, and WGS"
abstract: >-
  A Snakemake pipeline for processing RNA-seq, WES, and WGS data through quality
  control, alignment, base quality score recalibration, variant calling / gene
  quantification, and genetic ancestry estimation.
type: software
